| notes      = This infobox is used on pages of Objects, which are almost everything you see in the Game Window. It is used by more than 8000 pages, so changes here must be carefully thought of and tested before being implemented. Bigger changes can be tested on [[Template:Infobox Object/Draft]].

For an extended documentation of the parameters of this template, please check [[Template:Infobox Object/Documentation/Extended]].
